IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CLAWVM-PIN-BAL.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-BUDGET        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 REQ-PINNED          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 REQ-DYNAMIC         PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 ALLOC-PINNED        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CLAWVM-PIN-BAL.
    IF TOTAL-BUDGET == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF REQ-PINNED > TOTAL-BUDGET
        MOVE TOTAL-BUDGET TO ALLOC-PINNED.
    ELSE
        MOVE REQ-PINNED TO ALLOC-PINNED.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TOTAL-BUDGET.
    WEIGHT 30 ALLOC-PINNED.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
